  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blackout in Ukraine. Help Us Survive This Winter.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Imagine that you and your family are sitting at home in the cold, without electricity, water and internet for several days, cringing at the air alarms. This is the situation for millions of Ukrainians this winter. Their suffering only intensifies... We have already supported thousands of migrants and poor families affected by the war in Odessa city with housing, food and other assistance. Now it is critical to provide these people with the means to survive the blackouts. Help us do it today!</narrative>
  </description>
